(footprint "Shield_TE_2118716-2_16.5x16.5x3.6mm"
	(version 20260206)
	(generator "pcbnew")
	(generator_version "10.0")
	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "TE Connectivity 2118716-2 STANDARD SHIELD FRAME (two-piece; cover is a separate part). Body 16.50 x 16.50 x 3.60 mm, 0.20 mm CRS with 1.25-3.00 um matte tin. Land pattern taken from the TE customer drawing ENG_CD_2118716_A3 sheet 2: 17.30 x 17.30 mm segmented ring, 1.00 mm wide; the gaps line up with the notches in the bottom of the frame wall, so route signals out through a gap. Clear internal cavity 16.10 x 16.10 mm; copper-free area inside the land ring 15.30 x 15.30 mm. Frame has an internal cross with a 6.00 mm pick-and-place pad at the TOP face, so the cavity below it is clear. Stencil 0.10 mm min.")
